      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} \n\nI was using a 128x128 noise pattern, which was getting used for various objects around the scene for small details. It was just the texture as it turns out, and I had misdiagnosed the issue due to checking standard lite and not getting the same issue, which was because the tiling settings between the two shaders have a difference.\n\nAfter a while I was able to get a similar noise based texture with much less issue, but I can't cancel the report anymore.",
