  "details": "I try to stick to using VRChat's included shaders for avatars and worlds so I can upload to all platforms at once. However I didn't notice until recently that my materials were completely different for quest users.\n\nNormally a small discrepancy would be fine and expected for shader stuff, but this one is rather strong. I don't know if this is world specific or if it happens to avatars as well.",
